# Generic local rename preview pass
#
# Run only after prototype fixes and reanalysis. Copy this file, rename-pass.idac, and
# locals-plan.json into the recovery workspace, then refresh locals:
#   idac function locals list <function> --json --out /tmp/locals.json
# Replace the sample selectors in locals-plan.json with exact index or local_id values
# from that fresh output. Then run:
#   idac batch rename-preview.idac --lint --out /tmp/rename-preview.lint.json
#   idac batch rename-preview.idac --fail-fast --out /tmp/rename-preview.json
# Inspect the preview's full before/after local lists. Only then run rename-pass.idac
# against the same target; refresh and recalibrate if anything changed.

preview function locals apply 0x100000000 --json-file "locals-plan.json"
